      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUCORA (1) comes off an average run last start when fifth at this track over 390m behind Tough Enough (22.41) in a Mix 5. Was in the money prior to that. Should be very hard to beat this time. BLUEY IS BOUJEE (2) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fourth and beaten 4.5 lengths (22.16) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from five starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. RAIN ABOUT (3) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish second (25.80) at Grafton in a Grade 5 over 450m. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Winning chance. MAC DEUCE (8) will have admirers after surprising many with a placing last time out.",
